{"id":"word:hebrew:H693","type":"word","title":"אָרַב","subtitle":"H693 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to lurk","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אָרַב (H693) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 41 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אָרַב (ʼârab) means to lurk First listed occurrence: 1Sam 22 8."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אָרַב","transliteration":"ʼârab","pronunciation":"aw-rab'","strong":"H693","lemmaId":"hebrew:H693","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["לְ/אֹרֵ֖ב","אֹרֵ֥ב","מְ֠אָֽרְבִים","וְ/אָ֤רַב","וְ/אוֹרֵ֖ב"],"morphs":[["HVqrmsa",4],["HC/Td/Vqrmsa",4],["HTd/Vqrmsa",4],["HR/Vqrmsa",2],["HVprmpa",2],["HVqrmpa",2],["HC/Vqw3mp",2],["HVqp3cp",2],["HVqi3mp",2],["HVqi3fs",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to lurk","usage":"(lie in) ambush(-ment), lay (lie in) wait.","full":"H693. arab אָרַב verb lie in wait (Arabic be crafty ) — Qal Perfect וְאָרַב consecutive Deut 19:11 ; Judg 21:20 ; אָרָֽבְתִּי׃ Job 31:9 ; אָֽרְבוּ Psa 59:4 ; Lam 4:19 ; Imperfect יֶאֱרֹב Psa 10:9 (twice in verse); יֶאֱרֹ֑בוּ Prov 1:18 ; Micah 7:2 ; אֶרְבוּ וָיֶּ Judg 9:34 ; 16:2 ; נֶָֽאֶרְבָה Prov 1:11 ; Imperative אֱרֹב Judg 9:32 ; Infinitive אֱרָבֿ Prov 12:6 ; Participle אֹרֵב Josh 8:2 11 t.; אוֺרֵב 8:12 4 t.; אֹרְבִים 8:4 2 t; — lie in wait (with hostile purpose), absolute Judg 9:32 , 43 + 21:20 ; Job 31:9 ; Psa 10:9 ; Prov 7:12 ; 23:28 ; 1Sam 22:8 , 13 ; Lam 3:10 (of bear, compare Psa 10:9 ); with infinitive of purpose 10:9 ; with accusative ׳א דָּם Prov 12:6 ; with עַל , and person against whom Deut 19:11 ; Judg 9:34 ; usually with ל Micah 7:2 ; Judg 16:2 ; Psa 59:4 ; Prov 1:11 , 18 ; 24:15 ; Lam 4:19 compare Josh 8:2 , 4 , 14 ; Participle as substantive = liers-in-wait (plural) Judg 20:29 ; usually singular collective ambush Josh 8:2 , 12 , 14 , 19 , 21 ; Judg 16:9 , 12 ; 20:33 , 36 , 37 (twice in verse); 20:38 ; Ezra 8:31 ; plural of this singular = ambuscades Jer 51:12 ; singular = place of lying-in-wait, ambush (local sense) Josh 8:7 . Pi`el Participle plural liers-in-wait id quod Qal Participle מְאָֽרְבִים Judg 9:25 (with ל ), 2Chr 20:22 (with עַל ). ? Hiph`il Imperfect בנחל זַיָּרֶב (for וַיַּאֲרֶב ) 1Sam 15:5 (compare Dr Kö i. 390 ; Ges-Kau § 68. 2 queries ) but text dubious; compare Ol § 237 b, & Klo, who proposes בנחל ויעבר .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 22 8","keyReferences":["1Sam 22 8","1Sam 22 13","2Chr 20 22","Deut 19 11","Ezra 8 31","Hos 7 6","Jer 51 12","Job 31 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":41,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 22 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":22,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/אֹרֵ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqrmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 22 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":22,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/אֹרֵ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqrmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 20 22","book":"2Chr","chapter":20,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְ֠אָֽרְבִים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVprmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 19 11","book":"Deut","chapter":19,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אָ֤רַב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq3ms"},{"reference":"Ezra 8 31","book":"Ezra","chapter":8,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אוֹרֵ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmsa"},{"reference":"Hos 7 6","book":"Hos","chapter":7,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/אָרְבָּ֑/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Jer 51 12","book":"Jer","chapter":51,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/אֹֽרְבִ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"Job 31 9","book":"Job","chapter":31,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָרָֽבְתִּי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp1cs"},{"reference":"Josh 8 2","book":"Josh","chapter":8,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sou